<section class="club-panel" x-show="pane==='design'" x-cloak><h2>Live ID card preview</h2><p><span x-text="dims[0]"></span> × <span x-text="dims[1]"></span> mm · drag elements to move them</p>
<div x-ref="cardCanvas" class="membership-canvas" :style="{aspectRatio:dims[0]+'/'+dims[1],background:studio.card_color,fontFamily:studio.card_font}">
<img x-show="images[studio.card_background_file_id]" :src="images[studio.card_background_file_id]||''" class="card-background" alt="Card background"><div class="card-background" :style="{background:studio.card_color,opacity:(studio.card_overlay||0)/100}"></div>
<template x-for="(e,key) in studio.elements" :key="key"><div x-show="e.show" class="movable-element" :class="{'element-selected':selected===key}" :style="elementStyle(e)" @pointerdown="start($event,key)" @pointermove="move($event)" @pointerup="drag=null" @pointercancel="drag=null">
<template x-if="key==='logo'&&images[studio.card_logo_file_id]"><img :src="images[studio.card_logo_file_id]" alt="Card logo" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain"></template><template x-if="key==='qr'"><img :src="studio.previewQr" alt="QR preview" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain"></template><template x-if="key!=='qr'&&(key!=='logo'||!images[studio.card_logo_file_id])"><span x-text="text(key)"></span></template></div></template></div>
<p>Save the design, then open a member’s Export / ID card to download PNG, JPG or PDF.</p></section>
